# No other Docker build existed when the Companion self-host bundle was added.
# Keep the workspace context small enough that a local target tree (which can
# contain tens of gigabytes of desktop/mobile artifacts) is never sent to the
# Docker daemon.
**
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!crates/aokie-protocol/
!crates/aokie-protocol/**
!crates/aokie-realtime/
!crates/aokie-realtime/**
!deploy/
!deploy/companion-self-host/
!deploy/companion-self-host/container-workspace/
!deploy/companion-self-host/container-workspace/**
!deploy/companion-self-host/gateway-entrypoint.sh
